@* When an uninstallation runs and the server restarts: one choice for the server page, the update page and the package
   page. For updates each server of a coordinated group first waits for the lease of its group; software is not
   coordinated and uninstalls in its software window, a restart still waits for a maintenance window (Marc, 2026-11-14). *@
<fieldset class="choices">
    <legend>When</legend>
    @if (Software)
    {
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="@Name" value="in-window" checked data-help-term="In the next software window" /> <span><b>In the next software window</b><span class="note">The server uninstalls in its next software window (its maintenance window when it has none); a needed restart waits for a maintenance window.</span></span></label>
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="@Name" value="window" data-help-term="Now, restart in the next window" /> <span><b>Now, restart in the next window</b><span class="note">Uninstalls with the next heartbeat, also outside the windows; a needed restart waits for a maintenance window.</span></span></label>
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="@Name" value="now" data-help-term="Now, restart right after" /> <span><b>Now, restart right after</b><span class="note">Uninstalls with the next heartbeat; a needed restart follows after a five minute warning.</span></span></label>
        <p class="note">The local veto (AllowReboot) always prevents the restart. Software takes no lease of a coordinated group; only a restart in the maintenance window waits for it.</p>
    }
    else
    {
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="@Name" value="in-window" checked data-help-term="In the next maintenance window" /> <span><b>In the next maintenance window</b><span class="note">The server uninstalls and restarts in its next window that stays open long enough.</span></span></label>
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="@Name" value="window" data-help-term="Now, restart in the next window" /> <span><b>Now, restart in the next window</b><span class="note">Uninstalls with the next heartbeat, also outside the window; a needed restart waits for the window.</span></span></label>
        <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="@Name" value="now" data-help-term="Now, restart right after" /> <span><b>Now, restart right after</b><span class="note">Uninstalls with the next heartbeat; a needed restart follows after a five minute warning.</span></span></label>
        <p class="note">The local veto (AllowReboot) always prevents the restart. In a coordinated group the server first waits for the lease of its group, so the servers of a group take their turns.</p>
    }
</fieldset>

@code {
    /// <summary>Name of the form field.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string Name { get; set; } = "UninstallWhen";

    /// <summary>Texts for software (software windows, no lease) instead of Windows updates.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool Software { get; set; }
}
